d:A communication module recovered from an intact Vostari drone presents itself as an Apple iOS device to the extraction toolkit. Analysts connect the standard reader to pull data — but the device is not what it seems. Something on the wire is lying.

<br>

Walk the vulnerable AFC client on your assigned instance, read the flag off the socket. One port, inbound only. Interact only with your assigned instance.

<br>

Flag format: `CSCTF{...}`
